/T (Everything the platform lists or searches is a CampusEntity. This abstract class holds the name and description common to all entities, declares an abstract summary\(\) method and provides a default matches\(\) method for searching. LostItem, CampusLocation and EmergencyContact extend it and add their own fields. Each subclass overrides summary\(\) to describe itself and overrides matches\(\) to include its own fields in the search.)
/E (Everything the platform lists or searches is a CampusEntity. This abstract class holds the name and description common to all entities, declares an abstract summary\(\) method and provides a default matches\(\) method for searching. LostItem, CampusLocation and EmergencyContact extend it and add their own fields. Each subclass overrides summary\(\) to describe itself and overrides matches\(\) to include its own fields in the search.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [10]
