418 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 161 0 R
/T (The main window \(LOC8App\) is a JFrame containing a JTabbedPane with three tabs. The Lost & Found tab \(LostFoundPanel\) has a form on the left for reporting an item, a JTable in the centre listing all reports with a search box above it, and buttons to mark a report as recovered or to delete it. Selecting a row with a picture displays a scaled preview. A JFileChooser restricted to JPG and PNG files is used to attach an image. The Campus Search and Emergency Contacts tabs reuse one generic panel, EntityListPanel<T>. It contains a search box, a result list and a detail area. A DocumentListener refilters the list after every keystroke, so results update as the user types. The only difference between the two tabs is the data supplied and a small function that formats the detail text, which is an example of how inheritance and generics reduce duplicated code.)
/E (The main window \(LOC8App\) is a JFrame containing a JTabbedPane with three tabs. The Lost & Found tab \(LostFoundPanel\) has a form on the left for reporting an item, a JTable in the centre listing all reports with a search box above it, and buttons to mark a report as recovered or to delete it. Selecting a row with a picture displays a scaled preview. A JFileChooser restricted to JPG and PNG files is used to attach an image. The Campus Search and Emergency Contacts tabs reuse one generic panel, EntityListPanel<T>. It contains a search box, a result list and a detail area. A DocumentListener refilters the list after every keystroke, so results update as the user types. The only difference between the two tabs is the data supplied and a small function that formats the detail text, which is an example of how inheritance and generics reduce duplicated code.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
