/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 174 0 R
/T (Management, Smart Campus Search and Campus Emergency Contacts into a single Java Swing desktop application. The project demonstrates the main topics of the Object Oriented Programming course in one working program: an abstract base class with three subclasses, polymorphic method calls, generics, enums, exception handling, an event-driven graphical interface and file handling through serialisation, text files and image copying. The logic of the application was verified with 18 automated test cases, all of which passed, and the interface was checked using screenshots of the running panels.)
/E (Management, Smart Campus Search and Campus Emergency Contacts into a single Java Swing desktop application. The project demonstrates the main topics of the Object Oriented Programming course in one working program: an abstract base class with three subclasses, polymorphic method calls, generics, enums, exception handling, an event-driven graphical interface and file handling through serialisation, text files and image copying. The logic of the application was verified with 18 automated test cases, all of which passed, and the interface was checked using screenshots of the running panels.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
