/T (The application is simple to install and use, needs no network or database, and stores its data in plain files that can be backed up or edited. Its layered structure keeps the user interface, the search logic and the file handling separate, so that each can be improved independently.)
/E (The application is simple to install and use, needs no network or database, and stores its data in plain files that can be backed up or edited. Its layered structure keeps the user interface, the search logic and the file handling separate, so that each can be improved independently.)
