/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 174 0 R
/T (LOC8 is a single-computer application. Reports saved on one computer are not visible on another, and there is no login, so any user of the computer can delete any report. Search is by keyword only and does not match a lost report with a similar found report automatically. Campus facilities are described by text and do not show a map or directions. Serialised reports depend on the class definition, so a future change to LostItem must be made carefully to keep old files readable. The sample contact numbers for campus security and the medical room are placeholders and must be replaced with real numbers.)
/E (LOC8 is a single-computer application. Reports saved on one computer are not visible on another, and there is no login, so any user of the computer can delete any report. Search is by keyword only and does not match a lost report with a similar found report automatically. Campus facilities are described by text and do not show a map or directions. Serialised reports depend on the class definition, so a future change to LostItem must be made carefully to keep old files readable. The sample contact numbers for campus security and the medical room are placeholders and must be replaced with real numbers.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [11]
