1958 0 obj
<<
/Title (Campus users have no single, organised place to report lost or found belongings, to find out where a facility is located, or to reach essential support services quickly. The existing manual methods make the process slow, unstructured and unreliable: a report may never reach the person who needs it, a description is not recorded with a photograph, and nothing records whether an item has been returned. There is a need for a simple, user-friendly desktop application that stores reports with their details and supporting images, offers instant search over campus facilities and keeps emergency contact information one click away.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1952 0 R
