/Title (The aim of the project is to design and develop a centralised, easy-to-use desktop application, LOC8, that helps students, faculty, staff and visitors to locate lost items, campus facilities and essential support services. The system is built using Java, Java Swing, Object-Oriented Programming and File Handling, and is intended to be simple enough to run on any computer with a Java runtime and without any server or internet connection.)
