<<
/Title (The scope of LOC8 is a single-computer desktop application for a campus community. It covers reporting and managing lost and found items, searching campus facilities and viewing emergency contacts. Facility and contact data are held in editable CSV files, so the campus can update them without changing the program. The following are outside the scope of this version: sharing reports between several computers over a network, user accounts and login, live maps or GPS navigation, and automatic notifications by email or SMS. These are discussed as future enhancements in Chapter 8.)
